# /gstack-contrib-add-host

## Outcome
`/gstack-contrib-add-host` is finished only when this is true: Contributor-only skill: create a new host config for gstack's multi-host system. NOT installed for end users. Only usable from the gstack source repo.

## Constraints
This template is for gstack contributors working in the source repo. Do not install it for end users.

## Stop
Stop when the new host generates once and the generated tree matches a second run.

## Tool contract
Add `hosts/<name>.ts` with binary detection, skill roots, frontmatter transforms, and path rewrites. Wire it into `hosts/index.ts`. Do not publish the host until `bun run gen:skill-docs --host <name>` succeeds.
